{"availability":"available","full":"omdsh-dev/dsh-genui","name":"dsh-genui","description":"GenUI for DeepSeek Harness: interactive UI components rendered inline in assistant replies via the dsh-ui fence — layout, charts, plots, forms, quizzes, mermaid, 3D scenes, and an action event loop back to the model. Ships the fence-teaching host plugin, the browser renderer (client half), and the genui skill.","category":"Education","language":"TypeScript","stars":613,"forks":68,"created":"2026-08-13T13:07:52Z","updated":"2026-10-16T14:06:20Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://omdsh-dev.github.io/dsh-genui/","topics":["dsh","dsh-plugin"],"demo":"https://omdsh-dev.github.io/dsh-genui/","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-17T02:58:07.023Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-17T02:58:07.023Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-17T02:58:07.023Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-11T04:29:26.399Z","stars":542,"forks":64},{"at":"2026-10-17T02:58:07.023Z","stars":613,"forks":68}],"technologies":["React","Three.js"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Give the model's answers a face — the text is still there, and an interactive UI is already live. 🔌 Ecosystem: the repo carries the #dsh · #dsh-plugin topics — welcome to be listed by @dsh-plugin.","dsh-genui turns a model reply into a safe, interactive DSH surface. Ask “how are this month’s orders doing?” and the answer can include a sortable data panel, a native video, a draggable plot, a local quiz, or a persistent session panel — without replacing the surrounding text."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/omdsh-dev/dsh-genui/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"6c6f6aee88082d10d219df75f2b16cd0f606d56404186761c545a0429359a90e","extractedAt":"2026-10-11T04:29:26.542Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T04:29:26.542Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Give the model's answers a face — the text is still there, and an interactive UI is already live. 🔌 Ecosystem: the repo carrie